# ::tok The Tourism Bureau organized a large delegation of over 100 people from the Hong Kong government 's tourism department , the tourism industry , and media representatives to visit Macau . In addition to work meetings and industry discussions during the two - day ( 10th and 11th ) schedule , representatives from the Hong Kong travel agency industry and media visited various tourist attractions , hotels , and tourism - related facilities in Macau in batches . This is to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market , while promoting cultural and tourism linkage between the two places , and jointly expanding the " Hong Kong - Macau Joint Tour " market .
