# ::tok The visit will not only help deepen Vietnam 's cooperative relations with Singapore and Brunei in various traditional areas such as politics , diplomacy , economy , security , defense , education and training , oil and gas , tourism , and people - to - people exchanges , but also create a framework for cooperation between the countries in new potential areas such as digital economy , green economy , energy transformation , innovation and creativity , smart cities , and sustainable development .
