# ::tok When I made the purchase , the promotion on the page said that a " Three - Body Trilogy " would be given for free with purchases over 99 yuan . However , I did not receive this gift when I received the goods . When I called customer service , they asked me to show them a screenshot of the promotion at the time . The problem is , who saves screenshots of web pages when they make purchases ? You need customers to provide evidence for promotions you have run yourself . Buyers , be careful next time and keep evidence .
