# ::tok I consider the title of this anthology of novels to be a type of performance art , the author aims to convey that love is more than only the emotions experienced on stage , the rocks and dry sea in urban tales , and the bond that binds you and I together , not only should the aforementioned not be seen as a representation of love , but also of a life that is dull day in and day out , as plain as water , with a loss of life , denial of reality , and uncertainty about the future .
